            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention provides a preparation that is minimally colored through irradiation with light by coating a preparation containing a compound represented by formula (I) or a pharmaceutically acceptable salt thereof, or a crystal thereof with a light stabilizing substance and a polymer, particularly with one or more of titanium oxide and talc used as the light stabilizing substance and hypromellose used as the polymer.</p>
